{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We, the Ears, hear the voices of Aquasplendere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His blood flows over our world. He is the origin of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As representatives of the Great Deaf bloodline, it falls to you to guide our people through the generations and to be the architects of our lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will bathe in a world where water, the blood of Aquasplendere, nourishes and guides us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o1.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to shape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o2.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to build our infrastructures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o3.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will give birth to your heirs who will succeed one by one to lead the Great Cohort to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o4.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our bloodlines will be your ears to Aquasplendere, and you will choose the voices of Aquasplendere that will guide our path through the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o5.png?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is greater than Aquasplendere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519340?t=1745400834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/ad60cc1ad81bcbdbd3ae273646b5851e0f895317/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745400834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/b1bb7b51dc4c2c6578b2d8c41e49bbcf1b61842d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745400834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/b1bb7b51dc4c2c6578b2d8c41e49bbcf1b61842d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745400834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We, the Ears, hear the voices of Aquasplendere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His blood flows over our world. He is the origin of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As representatives of the Great Deaf bloodline, it falls to you to guide our people through the generations and to be the architects of our lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will bathe in a world where water, the blood of Aquasplendere, nourishes and guides us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o1.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to shape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o2.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to build our infrastructures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o3.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will give birth to your heirs who will succeed one by one to lead the Great Cohort to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o4.gif?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our bloodlines will be your ears to Aquasplendere, and you will choose the voices of Aquasplendere that will guide our path through the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/PetiteVid\u00e9o5.png?t=1745400834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is greater than Aquasplendere.</p>","developers":["Ivan Armandy"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/33917a974c0bc951b3acf953896aa2a5b6034a6a/header.jpg?t=1745400834","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126732,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126732/movie480.mp4?t=1745391444","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126732/movie_max.mp4?t=1745391444"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126732/c16b6536c35dab8b1018a17db50991f4f80fcf98/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745391444","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126732/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745391444","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126732/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745391444"}}],"name":"Aquasplendere","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul c